                "description",
                "Extractive splitter SP-5 on the Isopren-Twine acetonitrile train is mid-pass at 4.6 t/h with raffinate thermocouple 38.2 C under a 52.0 C packed-column ceiling while a vapor-head optical hitch still claims 61 C. The thermocouple arrival merely confirms a C5 cut that is already 1.1 t/h above the 3.5 t/h floor; no extra hold is licensed.",